	(text "1k in every line between the XC2064 and the Mega: if both drive a line against each other\n(design error, firmware, the bootloader blinking D13), at most 5 mA flow. Also limits the\ncurrent into an unpowered XC2064 to about 4 mA per pin. RC with ~25 pF: ~25 ns."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
